    "identified": false,
    "unidentified": {
      "description": "<p><em>A slender scimitar, its curved blade chased with fine gold and its grip bound in worn green leather — the steel seems to catch a faint light that isn't quite there.</em></p><p>The blade keeps its own history close. Only one who attunes to it will learn what it truly is, and all that it has witnessed.</p>",
      "name": "Gilded Scimitar"
    },
